#: apps/accounts/views/auth.py:61
msgid ""
"Obtain an access/refresh token pair. With the `X-Auth-Transport: cookie` "
"header (browsers) the tokens are set as HttpOnly cookies and omitted from "
"the body, and a CSRF token is required."
msgstr ""
"Obtém um par de tokens de acesso/refresh. Com o cabeçalho `X-Auth-Transport: "
"cookie` (navegadores), os tokens são definidos como cookies HttpOnly e "
"omitidos do corpo, e um token CSRF é obrigatório."

#: apps/accounts/views/auth.py:118
msgid ""
"Rotate the refresh token. Send `refresh` in the body (Bearer clients) or "
"rely on the refresh cookie (browsers). A refresh read from the cookie is "
"answered with new cookies and never with tokens in the body; it requires a "
"CSRF token."
msgstr ""
"Rotaciona o token de refresh. Envie `refresh` no corpo (clientes Bearer) ou "
"use o cookie de refresh (navegadores). Uma leitura do refresh pelo cookie é "
"respondida com novos cookies e nunca com tokens no corpo; requer um token "
"CSRF."

